OL,3,AFirst UK charges brought over 1994
OL,4,ARwanda genocide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Rwandan man, who has been living in
OL,7,Fnorth London, has become the first
OL,8,Fperson charged in the UK with offences
OL,9,Frelating to the 1994 Rwanda genocide
OL,10,Fagainst the Tutsi, the Crown
OL,11,FProsecution Service (CPS) has said.
OL,13,FDr Vincent Brown, formerly Dr Vincent
OL,14,FBajinya, 65, has been charged with one
OL,15,Foffence of conduct ancillary to
OL,16,Fgenocide and six offences of conduct
OL,17,Fancillary to murder as a crime against
OL,18,Fhumanity.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
