OL,3,AFirst UK charges brought over 1994
OL,4,ARwanda genocide
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrank Ferguson, head of the CPS's
OL,7,FSpecial Crime and Counter Terrorism
OL,8,FDivision, said Brown "is alleged to
OL,9,Fhave directed and incited acts of
OL,10,Fmurder and genocide carried out by
OL,11,Fothers".
OL,13,FBrown will appear at Westminster
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court on Tuesday.
